        "example": {
          "title": "Worked example — planning a fair test",
          "titleZh": "例题：设计一个公平测试",
          "task": "Plan a fair test for this question: How does the number of paper clips on a paper helicopter affect the time it takes to fall 2 metres?",
          "taskZh": "为下面的问题设计公平测试：纸飞旋翼（paper helicopter）上回形针的数量如何影响它下落 2 米所用的时间？",
          "steps": [
            "Name the IV (what I change): the number of paper clips — 0, 1, 2, 3 and 4.",
            "Name the DV (what I measure): the time to fall 2.0 m, in seconds, using a stopwatch.",
            "List the CVs (what I keep the same): the same helicopter design and paper, the same drop height, the same person timing, indoors with no draughts, released the same way.",
            "Write the hypothesis: If more paper clips are added, then the helicopter will fall in less time, because its greater weight needs a larger air-resistance force to balance it, so it falls faster.",
            "Write the method as numbered steps, with three drops for each number of clips.",
            "Plan the results table: number of paper clips in the first column, then Drop 1, Drop 2, Drop 3 and Mean time (s)."
          ],
          "stepsZh": [
            "写出自变量（我改变的）：回形针数量——0、1、2、3、4 个。",
            "写出因变量（我测量的）：用秒表测下落 2.0 m 所用的时间（秒）。",
            "列出控制变量（保持不变的）：同样的旋翼设计和纸张、同样的下落高度、同一个人计时、在没有风的室内、同样的放手方式。",
            "写出假设：如果回形针越多，那么下落时间越短，因为更大的重力需要更大的空气阻力才能平衡，所以它下落得更快。",
            "写出编号步骤，每种回形针数量各放三次。",
            "设计结果表格：第一列是回形针数量，后面依次是第 1、2、3 次和平均时间（s）。"
          ],
          "answer": "Method: 1. Make a paper helicopter (the same design every time). 2. Hold it with its base 2.0 m above the floor, measured with a tape measure. 3. Release it without throwing and start the stopwatch at the same moment. 4. Stop the stopwatch when it touches the floor and record the time. 5. Repeat twice more, then calculate the mean. 6. Add one paper clip to the base and repeat steps 2–5, up to four clips.",
          "answerZh": "步骤：1. 做一个纸飞旋翼（每次用同样的设计）。2. 用卷尺量好，让旋翼底部离地面 2.0 m。3. 松手（不要扔），同时开始计时。4. 旋翼落地时停表，记录时间。5. 再重复两次，计算平均值。6. 在底部加一个回形针，重复第 2–5 步，直到 4 个回形针。"
        },
