              "The two processes are linked: the products of photosynthesis (glucose and oxygen) are the reactants of respiration, and the products of respiration (carbon dioxide and water) are the reactants of photosynthesis. Both depend on diffusion. In your lungs, oxygen diffuses from the air sacs into the blood and carbon dioxide diffuses out. In a sunny leaf, carbon dioxide diffuses in through the stomata and oxygen diffuses out."
