        "example": {
          "title": "Worked example — using V = I × R",
          "titleZh": "例题：运用 V = I × R",
          "task": "A lamp has a resistance of 12 Ω, and a current of 0.5 A flows through it. (a) What is the voltage across the lamp? (b) If the voltage is increased to 9 V, what current flows, assuming the resistance stays the same?",
          "taskZh": "一个灯泡的电阻是 12 Ω，通过它的电流是 0.5 A。(a) 灯泡两端的电压是多少？(b) 如果电压增加到 9 V（假设电阻不变），电流是多少？",
          "steps": [
            "(a) Write the formula: V = I × R.",
            "Substitute, with units: V = 0.5 A × 12 Ω = 6 V.",
            "(b) Rearrange for current (in the triangle, V is on top with I and R below; cover I): I = V ÷ R.",
            "Substitute: I = 9 V ÷ 12 Ω = 0.75 A.",
            "Check that it makes sense: a bigger push (voltage) through the same resistance gives a bigger current."
          ],
          "stepsZh": [
            "(a) 写公式：V = I × R。",
            "代入数值并带单位：V = 0.5 A × 12 Ω = 6 V。",
            "(b) 变形求电流（三角形中 V 在上，I 和 R 在下，遮住 I）：I = V ÷ R。",
            "代入：I = 9 V ÷ 12 Ω = 0.75 A。",
            "检查是否合理：电阻不变时，推力（电压）越大，电流越大。"
          ],
          "answer": "(a) 6 V. (b) 0.75 A.",
          "answerZh": "(a) 灯泡两端电压为 6 V。(b) 电流为 0.75 A。"
        },
        "byHeart": [
          "Current: amperes (A), measured with an ammeter connected in series.",
          "Voltage: volts (V), measured with a voltmeter connected in parallel. Resistance: ohms (Ω).",
          "Series: one path; the current is the same everywhere; one break stops everything.",
          "Parallel: branch currents add up to the total; the voltage is the same across each branch; a break in one branch leaves the others working.",
          "V = I × R, so I = V ÷ R and R = V ÷ I."
        ],
        "byHeartZh": [
          "电流：单位安培（A），用串联的电流表测量。",
          "电压：单位伏特（V），用并联的电压表测量。电阻：单位欧姆（Ω）。",
          "串联：一条路径；电流处处相等；一处断开，全部停止。",
          "并联：各支路电流之和等于总电流；各支路电压相同；一条支路断开，其他支路照常工作。",
          "V = I × R，所以 I = V ÷ R，R = V ÷ I。"
        ],
