            "q": "A box with a weight of 240 N measures 0.2 m × 0.4 m × 0.5 m. (a) Calculate the area of each of its three different faces. (b) Calculate the greatest and the least pressure the box can exert on the floor. (c) Explain why tractors are fitted with very wide tyres.",
