            "model": "(a) 0.2 × 0.4 = 0.08 m²; 0.2 × 0.5 = 0.10 m²; 0.4 × 0.5 = 0.20 m². (b) Greatest pressure, on the smallest face: 240 N ÷ 0.08 m² = 3000 Pa. Least pressure, on the largest face: 240 N ÷ 0.20 m² = 1200 Pa. (c) A tractor is very heavy. Wide tyres spread its weight over a large area, so the pressure on the ground is low and the tractor does not sink into soft ground or squash the soil as much.",
            "modelZh": "(a) 0.2 × 0.4 = 0.08 m²；0.2 × 0.5 = 0.10 m²；0.4 × 0.5 = 0.20 m²。(b) 最大压强（最小的面朝下）：240 N ÷ 0.08 m² = 3000 Pa；最小压强（最大的面朝下）：240 N ÷ 0.20 m² = 1200 Pa。(c) 拖拉机很重。宽轮胎把重力分散到较大的面积上，对地面的压强小，拖拉机就不容易陷进松软的地里，也不会把土壤压得太实。"
